    },
    {
      "id": "4a28467732c44d2c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3360,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**离散型随机变量的概率密度表示**"
    },
    {
      "id": "f60f37397b4f4cf2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3360,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**类似齐次泊松过程，当已知 $X(t) = n$ 时（即在 $[0, t]$ 区间内共发生 $n$ 次事件），这 $n$ 次到达时刻**"
    },
    {
      "id": "4c4e0a3af09f4a8e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -359,
      "y": -3250,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**累积分布函数$F(x)$的连续性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "d321189819594e5d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -109,
      "y": -3250,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**线性相关性**"
    },
    {
      "id": "249c021aec6f4101",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 141,
      "y": -3250,
      "width": 220,
      "height": 80,
      "text": "**结果**"
    },
